{
  "id": "grammar-11",
  "world": "grammar",
  "order": 11,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "比較級與最高級",
  "titleEn": "Comparatives & Superlatives",
  "summary": "「比較…」和「最…」的說法。",
  "minutes": 15,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "中文說「比較便宜」、「最便宜」，英文會改變形容詞的樣子。",
        "短的字加 -er（比較）和 -est（最），例如 cheap → cheaper → cheapest。",
        "長的字前面加 more（比較）和 most（最），例如 expensive → more expensive → most expensive。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "變化規則："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "形容詞",
          "比較級（比較…）",
          "最高級（最…）"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "短字：cheap、fast",
            "cheaper、faster ＋ than",
            "the cheapest、the fastest"
          ],
          [
            "長字：expensive、popular",
            "more expensive ＋ than",
            "the most expensive"
          ],
          [
            "y 結尾：easy、busy",
            "easier、busier",
            "the easiest、the busiest"
          ],
          [
            "不規則：good、bad",
            "better、worse",
            "the best、the worst"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "看到 than 用比較級；看到 the ＋ 空格 ＋ in／of 用最高級。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "This hotel is cheaper than that one.",
          "zh": "這家飯店比那家便宜。",
          "highlight": "cheaper",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-11/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "Taipei 101 is the tallest building in Taiwan.",
          "zh": "台北 101 是台灣最高的大樓。",
          "highlight": "tallest",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-11/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "This model is more expensive than the old one.",
          "zh": "這個型號比舊的貴。",
          "highlight": "more",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-11/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "She is the best salesperson on the team.",
          "zh": "她是團隊裡最好的業務。",
          "highlight": "best",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-11/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "The new laptop",
              "label": "主詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "is",
              "label": "是"
            },
            {
              "text": "lighter",
              "label": "比較級"
            },
            {
              "text": "than the old one.",
              "label": "than ＋ 比較對象"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "看到 than，用比較級 lighter"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "This is",
              "label": "這是"
            },
            {
              "text": "the most popular",
              "label": "最高級（長字用 most）"
            },
            {
              "text": "dish",
              "label": "名詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "on the menu.",
              "label": "範圍"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "popular 是長字，最高級用 the most"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "This bag is more cheap than that one.",
          "right": "This bag is cheaper than that one.",
          "why": "cheap 是短字，直接加 -er。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "She is the most fast runner.",
          "right": "She is the fastest runner.",
          "why": "fast 是短字，最高級是 fastest。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "This is the goodest pizza.",
          "right": "This is the best pizza.",
          "why": "good 的最高級是 best（不規則）。"
        }
      ]
    },
